--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a0711db1b03ce448c93419c25aa574d8, type: 3}
  m_Name: IntroCutscene
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogLines:
  - speakerName: Kael
    dialogText: "Hey Noah. I\u2019m glad they assigned you to the Factory.\nThis
      is where the core of the Resonance Project lives\u2026 the parts most people
      never get to see.\nThe Towers are performing better than expected\u2014at least
      on the surface, the air seems cleaner. But\u2026 I still have doubts."
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 821e6a8b830c244dfa7fb63890d38916, type: 3}
  - speakerName: Kael
    dialogText: "And yet, in some areas, something is changing too fast. Something
      is\u2026 growing."
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a32ff0173f67741e8b01a544aeb9c605, type: 3}
  - speakerName: Kael
    dialogText: 'A few days ago, we recovered a living subject linked to these anomalies.

      It
      was found in the eastern sector of Prinswist,

      after a series of incidents
      no one could properly explain.'
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: baae380e455804300ab61a400533c71e, type: 3}
  - speakerName: Kael
    dialogText: "We still don\u2019t know if it\u2019s a chemical reaction, biological\u2026
      or something completely different. And it gets worse every day."
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b170e404183c940dd821fde370ee9ad4, type: 3}
  - speakerName: Kael
    dialogText: "It only moves when it hears certain sounds. It doesn\u2019t react
      to everything, it chooses. It\u2019s as if\u2026 it were reading the environment
      through hearing."
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 98556cef83e9247cfa4b79970c832099, type: 3}
  - speakerName: Kael
    dialogText: "That\u2019s why you\u2019re here, Noah. I want to understand if
      there\u2019s a pattern. Welcome to the Factory."
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9481b6da0c6a2420ab40d9a2560f6a6a, type: 3}
  - speakerName: Kael
    dialogText: "I\u2019ll let you use our latest prototype: an echolocator. If it
      works the way I think\u2026 we\u2019ll see what it \u201Chears\u201D."
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9f36b2f3dd4ac4c398170a10ddf18b20, type: 3}
  - speakerName: Kael
    dialogText: "Observe, study. And try not to make too much noise. I\u2019ll go
      back to analyzing the data\u2026 something doesn\u2019t add up."
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2fe25cf1a61b7418fb1e19e40223d70e, type: 3}
